# BAWAAL custom emoji / reactions (LOCKED — exclusive)

The ~106 skeleton PNGs (`assets/skel_*.png` and/or `assets/skeletons/`) mapped through **`BawaalEmoji`** are the **official and exclusive** emoji / reaction system for BAWAAL.

## Canonical files

| File | Role |
|---|---|
| `components/BawaalEmoji.js` | `<BawaalEmoji name size />` — uniform 1:1 `Image` (`resizeMode="contain"`) |
| `src/constants/bawaalEmojiAssets.js` | Full key → `require` map + aliases + `getBawaalEmojiSource` |
| `components/FullEmojiPickerDrawer.js` | Full vault grid for browsing all keys |

## Mandatory surfaces

Chat bubbles · comment / banter rows · DM reactions · Banter reaction tray · emotion / reaction pills · floating banter reactions.

Every one of these **MUST** render `<BawaalEmoji name="…" size={n} />` (or resolve via `getBawaalEmojiSource` / `hasBawaalEmoji`). Default / missing key → `laughing1` (`skel_laughing1.png`).

## Never re-add

- Unicode / system emoji stickers in reaction pickers (e.g. 🔥 💀 🐐 💪 🚀 😂 ⚡ 🏆 💬)
- Generic vector icon packs as reaction glyphs on those surfaces
- Parallel emoji maps or local sticker arrays that bypass `bawaalEmojiAssets.js`

## Persistence & inline shortcodes

Store reaction keys (`head_on_fire`, `gold_cup`, …), `:key:` shortcodes, or `[bawaal:key]` markers — **not** unicode glyphs — on comment / banter payloads. Banter compose inserts `:key:` via `FullEmojiPickerDrawer`; render with `BawaalEmojiText` / `<BawaalEmoji>` (`src/utils/bawaalEmojiText.js`).

## Out of scope

Marketing / mode **labels** in non-reaction chrome (e.g. SPARKS / JOSH titles) are unrelated; do not use that as a reason to put unicode into chat or banter pickers.
